# @local/dsh-wolfram
#
# This package is a zero-build DSH Host plugin, installed into a profile by
# linking this directory. Everything it needs at runtime is committed: the
# entry point, lib/, locale/, docs (README.md), the icon, and the bundle patch.
# Nothing is generated inside this directory, so the rules below only keep
# machine-local debris out of the history.

# --- dependencies -----------------------------------------------------------
# The plugin has none today; ignore them if someone adds a dependency later.
node_modules/
.pnp.*
.yarn/cache/
.yarn/install-state.gz

# --- local scratch ----------------------------------------------------------
# Manual debugging of lib/runner.wls (PLAN.md appendix B) can leave these behind.
.scratch/
*.tmp
*.temp

# --- test and coverage output ----------------------------------------------
# test/verify.mjs runs entirely in the OS temp directory and writes nothing here.
coverage/
.nyc_output/
*.lcov

# --- logs ------------------------------------------------------------------
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# --- secrets and local overrides -------------------------------------------
# The bundle row in the profile's cordis.patch.yml is the place for local
# settings; never commit credentials or machine-specific overrides here.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.local

# --- editors and IDEs -------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# --- operating-system metadata ---------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
